    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Inlet Breeze Features<br>- Pet Friendly for up to 2 dogs, 60 pounds or less, non-aggressive breeds only. Approval from Exclusive 30A and payment of a non-refundable pet fee is required prior to your arrival.<br>- Located in the luxury Barberry Coast neighborhood of Inlet Beach<br>- 1 Minute walk along the tree lined path behind the home to the community pool<br>- 2 Minute walk to the private neighborhood beach access<br>- 2 Minute bike ride to upscale shopping and dining in Rosemary Beach<br>- 3 Minute bike ride to 30Avenues, with great shopping, dining, and scheduled entertainment options. A pedestrian bridge is available to safely travel to this must visit location.<br>- Access to 4 Taxi Bikes included with your stay<br>- Partial Gulf view from the top floor balcony<br>- Landscaped yard with outdoor dining area, propane grill, and entrance to the path which takes you to the community pool and private beach access<br>- Private outdoor spaces on every floor of the home, including a back porch with a bench swing<br>- 2nd Floor kitchen that is well supplied for cooking, including a Keurig plus drip coffee maker and wine fridge<br>- 2nd Floor main living area with large Smart TV<br>- 2nd Floor dining area includes two dining tables plus breakfast bar seating<br>- Outdoor dining on the 2nd floor covered balcony<br>- 1st Floor laundry center<br>- WIFI and Cable available<br>- Driveway parking for 3 vehicles. RVs, trailers, and street parking are prohibited in the neighborhood<br>- Concierge services including beach chair rentals at the nearby public beach access, additional bike rentals, grocery delivery, and baby equipment rentals available<br>- At least one mid-stay clean is required for any reservation 10 days or longer and this cost is included in your reservation. Extra cleans can be scheduled for an additional fee<br><br>5 Bedrooms plus Bunk Area, 5 Full Baths, Sleeps 12<br>- 3rd Floor King Suite: semi-private as room encompasses the entire floor but there is no door to fully enclose the room, partial Gulf view from the private furnished balcony, TV, ensuite bath with a walk-in shower<br>- 2nd Floor King Suite: TV, walk-in closet, private furnished balcony, ensuite bath with a walk-in shower<br>- 1st Floor King Suite: TV, reach-in closet , ensuite access to shared Jack and Jill Bath with a walk-in shower<br>- 1st Floor Queen Suite: TV, reach-in closet, ensuite access to shared Jack and Jill Bath with a walk-in shower<br>- 1st Floor Bunk Room: sleeps 2 in a Twin over Twin Bunk, semi-private, kitchenette with mini-fridge and microwave, Roku TV, hallway access to a shared full bath with a combination shower/tub<br>- 1st Floor Bunk Area: sleeps 2 in a Twin over Twin built in bunk area, hallway access to a shared full bath with a combination shower/tub<br>- 2nd Floor Full Guest Bath with a walk-in shower<br><br>Discover the perfect retreat in Inlet Beach, where you can have your toes in the sand in two minutes when you stroll along the tree-lined neighborhood path to the community pool and private beach entrance. Located next to Rosemary Beach, you will enjoy exploring the best 30A has to offer thanks to the 4 Taxi bikes available at the home. Inlet Breeze offers spacious accommodations for up to 12 guests, including three king suites and two bunk areas. The well-appointed home features beautiful private outdoor spaces to sit and reconnect with loved ones. <br><br>Located in the upscale community of Barberry Coast, you will enjoy the community amenities only shared with a small number of homes. These include a beautiful community pool and private beach access, both a short stroll from the home. Beach service available the nearby public beach access on Winston Lane.<br><br>A memorable family vacation should include all family members, even the furry ones. We welcome up to two well behaved dogs, 60 pounds or less at the home. You and your pup will enjoy exploring the neighborhood and nearby Rosemary Beach. Be sure to check out the special pet focused vendors at the weekend farmers market in Rosemary Beach.<br><br>The 30A area is continually growing and evolving. As a result, nearby construction, renovations, or public works projects may occur during your stay. While we strive to provide an exceptional experience, these activities are beyond our control. Refunds or discounts cannot be offered for construction-related noise, disruptions, or changes in views.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
